# Editor / atomic-write temporary files.
# `shopify theme dev` watches the folder and can catch these mid-write; their
# names (e.g. cart-live.liquid.tmp.22452.e901167f8e7c) contain characters the
# Asset API rejects as "illegal characters", which aborts the sync.
*.tmp
*.tmp.*
*.liquid.tmp.*
*~
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Store/theme customizer data and content layouts.
# Keep these out of pushes when deploying code-only changes.
config/settings_data.json
templates/*.json
sections/*.json

# Local generated files.
tmp/
Screenshot*.png
